# GitHub Linguist Overrides
# Treat MDX and docs as documentation so they don't skew repository language stats
*.mdx linguist-documentation
*.md linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation
.docs/** linguist-documentation

# Treat agent skills and external reference files as vendored
.agents/** linguist-vendored
.agents/** linguist-documentation
reference/** linguist-vendored
e2e/harness/** linguist-vendored
